    <StreamGeometry x:Key="IconDiagnostics">M3 13H7L9 5L14 20L17 11L18.5 14H21V12H17.5L16 9L13 18L10 3L7.5 11H3V13Z</StreamGeometry>
    <StreamGeometry x:Key="IconPower">M13 3H11V13H13V3ZM17.83 5.17L16.41 6.59C17.99 7.86 19 9.81 19 12C19 15.87 15.87 19 12 19C8.13 19 5 15.87 5 12C5 9.81 6.01 7.86 7.58 6.58L6.17 5.17C4.23 6.82 3 9.26 3 12C3 16.97 7.03 21 12 21C16.97 21 21 16.97 21 12C21 9.26 19.77 6.82 17.83 5.17Z</StreamGeometry>
