    <StreamGeometry x:Key="IconTrash">M6 19C6 20.1 6.9 21 8 21H16C17.1 21 18 20.1 18 19V7H6V19ZM19 4H15.5L14.5 3H9.5L8.5 4H5V6H19V4Z</StreamGeometry>
    <StreamGeometry x:Key="IconServer">M4 2C2.9 2 2 2.9 2 4V8C2 9.1 2.9 10 4 10H20C21.1 10 22 9.1 22 8V4C22 2.9 21.1 2 20 2H4ZM4 4H20V8H4V4ZM4 14C2.9 14 2 14.9 2 16V20C2 21.1 2.9 22 4 22H20C21.1 22 22 21.1 22 20V16C22 14.9 21.1 14 20 14H4ZM4 16H20V20H4V16ZM6 5H8V7H6V5ZM6 17H8V19H6V17Z</StreamGeometry>
    <StreamGeometry x:Key="IconFolder">M10 4H4C2.9 4 2 4.9 2 6V18C2 19.1 2.9 20 4 20H20C21.1 20 22 19.1 22 18V8C22 6.9 21.1 6 20 6H12L10 4ZM4 6H9.17L11.17 8H20V18H4V6Z</StreamGeometry>
