    <StreamGeometry x:Key="IconSave">M17 3H5C3.89 3 3 3.89 3 5V19C3 20.1 3.89 21 5 21H19C20.1 21 21 20.1 21 19V7L17 3M19 19H5V5H16.17L19 7.83V19M12 12C10.34 12 9 13.34 9 15C9 16.66 10.34 18 12 18C13.66 18 15 16.66 15 15C15 13.34 13.66 12 12 12M6 6H15V10H6V6Z</StreamGeometry>
